  "summary": "Since a kid I’ve had many interests in the world, from mechanics, welding, art, and technology. I’ve been working as a welder for the last 5 years and I’ve been hell bent on changing course into the tech field. I have strong interest in team member work, brainstorming and puzzle solving... I’ve been known to desire knowledge and understanding as well as big projects. I feel like I have an interesting take on most things that not everyone sees.\n\nSince 2016 I’ve been self studying web development and some programming in between working hours. \n\nI have a local library of web dev projects, as well as some graphic designs for some small businesses. \n\nI have desire to spread my wings farther than they are now, as a father and a importantly a creator.",
